        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 414.09000000000003,
          "end": 416.34000000000003,
          "en": "and write this code like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 416.34000000000003,
          "end": 418.8,
          "en": "Also get rid of this semicolon here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 418.8,
          "end": 422.19,
          "en": "This is then the shortest possible way of writing this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 422.19,
          "end": 425.37,
          "en": "And another advantage of using such a arrow function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 425.37,
          "end": 428.64,
          "en": "because this is now a very short, concise piece of code",
